\ Exact cutlet-composition regression examples, independently
\ enumerated for ten spans and three positive cutlet lengths.
\ No mandatory boundary: 36 possibilities C(9,2).
\ Mandatory internal boundary after span four: 8=C(8,1).
\ The required-gate compositions in lexical order are:
\ [1,3,6], [2,2,6], [3,1,6],
\ [4,1,5], [4,2,4], [4,3,3], [4,4,2], [4,5,1].
\ The source is awaiting CAL execution.

The samplecutletrank is a wide quantity.
The examinedcutletpiece is a cutlet piece.

To check cutlet partition counts:
  Put 10 into the cutlet partition's total spans.
  Put 3 into the cutlet partition's part count.
  Put 0 into the cutlet partition's required boundary.
  Count the permitted cutlet partitions.
  If the cutlet partition's total choices is not "36",
    put "Unrestricted ten-span partition count is not 36." into the check report; exit.
  Put 4 into the cutlet partition's required boundary.
  Count the permitted cutlet partitions.
  If the cutlet partition's total choices is not "8",
    put "Pinned ten-span partition count is not eight." into the check report; exit.
  Put 10 into the cutlet partition's required boundary.
  Count the permitted cutlet partitions.
  If the cutlet partition's total choices is not "0",
    put "A closing gate was mistaken for an internal gate." into the check report; exit.
  Put 130 into the cutlet partition's total spans.
  Put 17 into the cutlet partition's part count.
  Put 0 into the cutlet partition's required boundary.
  Count the permitted cutlet partitions.
  If the cutlet partition's total choices is not "106559732167812574200",
    put "A large unrestricted cutlet count lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  Put 65 into the cutlet partition's required boundary.
  Count the permitted cutlet partitions.
  If the cutlet partition's total choices is not "13216710966550396800",
    put "A large pinned cutlet count lost precision." into the check report; exit.

\ Verify three positive selected lengths and make sure no extra part
\ is silently attached to the linked result.
To verify three selected cutlet spans given a number and another number and a third number:
  Put the chosen cutlet pieces' first into the examinedcutletpiece.
  If the examinedcutletpiece is nil,
    put "A cutlet partition was unexpectedly empty." into the check report; exit.
  If the examinedcutletpiece's span length is not the number,
    put "The first cutlet span differed from the reference." into the check report; exit.
  Put the examinedcutletpiece's next into the examinedcutletpiece.
  If the examinedcutletpiece is nil,
    put "A cutlet partition ended after one part." into the check report; exit.
  If the examinedcutletpiece's span length is not the other number,
    put "The second cutlet span differed from the reference." into the check report; exit.
  Put the examinedcutletpiece's next into the examinedcutletpiece.
  If the examinedcutletpiece is nil,
    put "A cutlet partition ended after two parts." into the check report; exit.
  If the examinedcutletpiece's span length is not the third number,
    put "The third cutlet span differed from the reference." into the check report; exit.
  If the examinedcutletpiece's next is not nil,
    put "The selected cutlet partition has too many parts." into the check report; exit.

\ CAL 4018 treats repeated indefinite-article selector calls within one
\ check as repeated local declarations. Isolate this call in one procedure.
To invoke the sample cutlet selector:
  Select a cutlet partition from the samplecutletrank.

To check unrestricted cutlet ranking:
  Put 10 into the cutlet partition's total spans.
  Put 3 into the cutlet partition's part count.
  Put 0 into the cutlet partition's required boundary.
  Put "1" into the samplecutletrank.
  Invoke the sample cutlet selector.
  If the cutlet partition's valid selection is not 1,
    put "First unrestricted composition was not accepted." into the check report; exit.
  Verify three selected cutlet spans given 1 and 1 and 8.
  Put "36" into the samplecutletrank.
  Invoke the sample cutlet selector.
  If the cutlet partition's valid selection is not 1,
    put "Last unrestricted composition was not accepted." into the check report; exit.
  Verify three selected cutlet spans given 8 and 1 and 1.

To check pinned cutlet ranking:
  Put 10 into the cutlet partition's total spans.
  Put 3 into the cutlet partition's part count.
  Put 4 into the cutlet partition's required boundary.
  Put "1" into the samplecutletrank.
  Invoke the sample cutlet selector.
  If the cutlet partition's valid selection is not 1,
    put "First pinned composition was not accepted." into the check report; exit.
  Verify three selected cutlet spans given 1 and 3 and 6.
  Put "5" into the samplecutletrank.
  Invoke the sample cutlet selector.
  Verify three selected cutlet spans given 4 and 2 and 4.
  Put "8" into the samplecutletrank.
  Invoke the sample cutlet selector.
  Verify three selected cutlet spans given 4 and 5 and 1.
  Put "9" into the samplecutletrank.
  Invoke the sample cutlet selector.
  If the cutlet partition's valid selection is not 0,
    put "Out-of-range cutlet rank was accepted." into the check report; exit.
  Put "0" into the samplecutletrank.
  Invoke the sample cutlet selector.
  If the cutlet partition's valid selection is not 0,
    put "Zero was accepted as a one-based cutlet rank." into the check report; exit.
